# Alert delivery for LLM SERVER STATUS - copy to ~/.config/lss/alert.env and set ONE of these.
#
# The collector runs whatever `alert_cmd` names (install.sh writes ~/.local/bin/lss-notify.sh)
# as:  <alert_cmd> <severity> <message>   where severity is info | warn | page | hardware.
# This file is read by BOTH dispatchers that ship:
#   lss-notify.sh   the generic one - a hook URL or your own command (below)
#   lss-alert.sh    the fleet one - agent mail + a banner on another machine over ssh
#
# Set ONE hook. If you set more than one, lss-notify.sh uses the first in this order.

# 1. ntfy - the simplest: pick a hard-to-guess topic, no account needed.
#    Subscribe in the ntfy app / a browser tab. Anyone who knows the topic sees your alerts,
#    so make it long and random (e.g. https://ntfy.sh/lss-7f3a91c2e5).
#LSS_NOTIFY_NTFY=https://ntfy.sh/your-private-topic

# 2. Any HTTP endpoint. It receives POST {"severity":"warn","message":"..."} - Slack, Discord,
#    a Teams workflow URL, your own bot, an internal webhook receiver.
#LSS_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK=https://hooks.example.com/T000/B000/xxxxxxxx

# 3. A command you already have. Run as `$LSS_NOTIFY_CMD <severity> <message>`.
#    On Linux desktop:   LSS_NOTIFY_CMD="notify-send LLM-SERVER"
#    On macOS:           LSS_NOTIFY_CMD="osascript -e 'display notification'"
#    By mail:            LSS_NOTIFY_CMD="mail -s LLM-SERVER you@example.com"
#LSS_NOTIFY_CMD=notify-send LLM-SERVER

# Optional (lss-notify.sh)
#LSS_NOTIFY_TIMEOUT=10          # seconds per HTTP attempt
#LSS_NOTIFY_NO_BANNER=0         # 1 = never fall back to a macOS Notification Centre banner
#LSS_NOTIFY_DRY_RUN=0           # 1 = print what would be sent, send nothing

# The fleet dispatcher (scripts/lss-alert.sh) instead: an agent on the seat, over ssh.
#LSS_ALERT_SEAT=my-seat-host
#LSS_ALERT_AGENT=<your-agent>
#LSS_ALERT_AGENT_CMD=agentctl      # the agent CLI on the seat (`<cmd> agent wait|prompt <target>`); set it to yours
#LSS_ALERT_AGENT_FALLBACK=         # more targets, space-separated, tried ONLY when the one before does not exist
